These are the relay list contract's twelve Ed25519 edge vectors
(<workspace>/docs/contracts/relay-list.md, The edge vectors). speccheck_test.go checks the
file's SHA-256 against the value above before parsing a byte of it, and holds every case to the
contract's verdict, case 11 accepted.

